   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Samantha is feeding the horses at her barn. She has 6 buckets of oats. If each horse eats&nbsp;<span><span data-math=\"\\frac34\">\\frac34</span> bucket of oats, how many horses can she feed at most?</span>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1222430,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"x\\leq10\">x\\leq10</span>, Samantha can feed a maximum of 10 horses."
    },
